# ============================================================================
#  错题集生成器 · Git 忽略规则
#  最高原则：任何密钥、凭据、学生隐私数据一律不得进入版本库。
# ============================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. 密钥与凭据（最高优先级 —— 绝不提交）
#    规则经过实测：新建 .env / *.key / *secret*.py 后 git status 必须保持干净。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# --- 1.1 环境变量文件 ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
.envrc
*.envrc

# --- 1.2 私钥与证书 ---
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.ppk
*.der
*.cer
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*

# --- 1.3 凭据 / 令牌文件（覆盖各语言扩展名）---
*_secret.*
*secret*.json
*secret*.py
*secret*.js
*secret*.ts
*secret*.vue
*secret*.yaml
*secret*.yml
*secret*.toml
*secret*.ini
*secret*.cfg
secrets.json
secrets.yaml
secrets.yml
credentials.json
*credentials*.json
*credential*.json
*credential*.py
*credential*.js
*credential*.ts
*service_account*.json
*service-account*.json
service_account.json
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
firebase*.json
firebase-adminsdk*.json
auth.json
*.token
token*.json
*_token.*
*_tokens.*
api_key*
apikey*
*_api_key*
*api_keys*
openai*.json
config.local.*
local.settings.json

# --- 1.4 工具链凭据文件（常含明文令牌）---
.npmrc
.pypirc
.netrc
_netrc
.dockercfg
.docker/config.json
terraform.tfvars
*.tfvars
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. 学生隐私数据（真实姓名 / 成绩 / 答题情况 —— 绝不提交）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
错题集/
错题集*/
图片/
题目配置/
题目配置.json
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.docx
*.docm

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. 试卷与素材大文件（版权 + 体积，不提交）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pdf
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.iso

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. 本地机器配置（含 E:\wtt 绝对路径，换机即失效）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
settings.json

